---
description: Protect generated, migration, lockfile, frozen, and archived rule sources.
globs: "**/migrations/**, **/drizzle/meta/**, **/*.generated.*, pnpm-lock.yaml, .ai-rules/**, archive/**"
alwaysApply: false
---

- Applied migrations and tool-owned migration metadata are append-only; create a new migration through the repository workflow.
- Generated files change through their owning schema, registry, or generator.
- `pnpm-lock.yaml` changes only through pnpm.
- `.ai-rules/` is frozen reference material during ordinary project implementation.
- `archive/` holds retired rule bundles: read on explicit request, never edited; new lessons go into the native layer.
